/T (A senior manager has been redesigning her team's workflow around AI. A twelve-hour reporting process now takes three. Her team is operating at a level it wasn't six months ago. Her outputs are materially better. At performance review, she is assessed against exactly the same criteria as her peers who changed nothing. Her ranking is indistinguishable from theirs. She receives no recognition for what she built. The following year, she stops building.)
