/T (An organisation completes a six-month AI upskilling programme. Completion rates are high. Assessment scores are strong. Facilitator feedback is positive. Six months later, the tools are open in browser tabs and used occasionally rather than fluently, applied at the margins of work rather than at its centre. The programme was well-designed. The skills were transferred. The adoption is shallow.)
/E (An organisation completes a six-month AI upskilling programme. Completion rates are high. Assessment scores are strong. Facilitator feedback is positive. Six months later, the tools are open in browser tabs and used occasionally rather than fluently, applied at the margins of work rather than at its centre. The programme was well-designed. The skills were transferred. The adoption is shallow.)
