/T (A senior manager needs to make a significant decision. The AI system available to her has produced an output that is more thorough and better structured than anything she could have produced in the time available. Her organisation has an AI policy. It states that AI tools may be used "where appropriate and with professional judgement." It does not define appropriate. It does not tell her whether she is accountable for the output if she uses it, how to disclose it, or whether a decision made with AI input carries different weight than one made without it. She sets the output aside and makes the decision the way she has always made it. Two hours later than she needed to. The value was available. The conditions for using it were not.)
/E (A senior manager needs to make a significant decision. The AI system available to her has produced an output that is more thorough and better structured than anything she could have produced in the time available. Her organisation has an AI policy. It states that AI tools may be used "where appropriate and with professional judgement." It does not define appropriate. It does not tell her whether she is accountable for the output if she uses it, how to disclose it, or whether a decision made with AI input carries different weight than one made without it. She sets the output aside and makes the decision the way she has always made it. Two hours later than she needed to. The value was available. The conditions for using it were not.)
