/T (The reason this question is not being asked systematically is that there has been no diagnostic built specifically to answer it. Technology audits assess the infrastructure. Data maturity assessments measure the state of the inputs AI works on. Engagement surveys measure sentiment. Skills assessments measure capability transfer. None of them measure the conditions that determine whether capability can function, whether sentiment translates to behaviour, or whether infrastructure produces value. None of them identify the binding constraint. The measurement gap is structural. It has been unaddressed. The cost of it is visible, at scale, across sectors, in the AI investment returns of enterprises running transformation programmes today.)
