/T (The pattern that makes this principle necessary appears consistently across the sectors and investment levels in which it has so far been observable. Organisations with genuinely sophisticated late-stage conditions, strong governance frameworks, well-designed adoption infrastructure, real commitment at the frontline, returning no measurable enterprise value. On examination, in case after case, the reason is the same: an upstream condition was absent, was never measured, and was never addressed. The downstream investment was sound. The upstream constraint made it largely irrelevant. This is the structural pattern this body of work argues for, and the founding cohort dataset is being built specifically to test whether it holds as the model predicts, because the human layer that produces it has never been systematically measured.)
/E (The pattern that makes this principle necessary appears consistently across the sectors and investment levels in which it has so far been observable. Organisations with genuinely sophisticated late-stage conditions, strong governance frameworks, well-designed adoption infrastructure, real commitment at the frontline, returning no measurable enterprise value. On examination, in case after case, the reason is the same: an upstream condition was absent, was never measured, and was never addressed. The downstream investment was sound. The upstream constraint made it largely irrelevant. This is the structural pattern this body of work argues for, and the founding cohort dataset is being built specifically to test whether it holds as the model predicts, because the human layer that produces it has never been systematically measured.)
