385 0 obj
<<
/Title (their binding constraint is more likely Cultural Permission tend to build excellent governance over a workforce that has no real permission to act on what it governs. The investment is real in both cases. The upstream constraint makes it irrelevant in both cases. An AI investment decision made without understanding the likely binding constraint risks being allocated to the wrong condition first. The average enterprise AI programme takes twelve to eighteen months to demonstrate stall. That is twelve to eighteen months of compounding the wrong sequence.)
