/Title (The governing principle is simple, and it has been visible in the failure pattern of AI transformation long enough to state directly: upstream first. Identify the binding constraint. Address it before investing in the conditions that depend on it. Then build on a foundation that can hold what you build on top of it.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 356 0 R
