/Title (What becomes visible when this pattern is named is not new behaviour. It is behaviour that was always there. Investment flowing through a layer that was never measured, value being lost in places that were never identified, now legible for the first time. The numbers reflect it. S&P Global's 2025 survey found that 2.5 times more organisations abandoned AI programmes in 2025 than the year before. McKinsey found that only 1% of companies believe they have reached AI maturity. These are not the numbers of a technology failing to deliver. They are the numbers of organisations investing into a system they have not measured, and discovering, at considerable cost, that the constraint was not where they thought it was.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 391 0 R
/Next 408 0 R
>>
endobj
