/Title (Incentive structures and performance frameworks are the real communication channel of any organisation. They tell people, with more precision than any strategy document or communications programme, what the organisation actually values. When those structures contradict the stated AI ambition, when the people who experiment are not distinguished from the people who do not, when redesigning how work is done carries no measurable reward, the organisation has created a contradiction that training cannot resolve and communications cannot paper over. The permission that matters is not granted in an announcement. It is granted when the architecture of reward changes to reflect the strategy. Until then, people are not resistant. They are rational.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 396 0 R
/Prev 413 0 R
>>
