/Title (Eighteen months later, there are pilots. Some are genuinely impressive. None have scaled. The question of why produces different answers from different functions, all of them partial and none of them wrong. The organisation is not uncommitted. It is not under-invested. It has no coherent strategic logic for what AI is for, and that absence makes every downstream decision less productive than it should be. This is the vision vacuum. It is the most upstream failure in the system, and the one that most consistently goes unnamed.)
/Dest [13 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 400 0 R
/Prev 421 0 R
>>
